# Test your FastAPI endpoints (local: uvicorn en :8001; sin TARIFF_API_KEY no hace falta el header)
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8001
@key = local

GET {{base}}/
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{base}}/hello/User
Accept: application/json

###

# Catálogos
GET {{base}}/tariffs/companies?q=avianca
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

###

GET {{base}}/tariffs/fees
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

###

GET {{base}}/tariffs/commodities
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

###

# Analizar un PDF (client_id e instructions son opcionales)
POST {{base}}/tariffs/parse
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="rates.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./pdfs/rates.pdf
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="client_id"

3081
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="instructions"

The MIN column is in USD.
--WebAppBoundary--

###

# Términos guardados de una empresa
GET {{base}}/tariffs/terms?company_id=3081
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

###

# Guardar términos: instrucciones + archivo nuevo; keep = archivos ya guardados que se conservan
POST {{base}}/tariffs/terms
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="company_id"

3081
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="company_name"

Avianca Cargo
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="instructions"

Rates are always from MIA.
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="keep"

[]
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="terms.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./terms.txt
--WebAppBoundary--

###

# Insertar (header.fees = todas las filas; rows[].fees = solo esa fila)
POST {{base}}/tariffs/insert
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "header": {"provider_id": 9, "airline_id": 3081, "commodity_id": 4, "valid_to": "2026-12-31",
             "fuel_fee_id": 13, "fees": [{"fee_id": 101, "fee_comment": null, "cost_unit": 0.1}]},
  "rows": [{"origin": "MIA", "destination": "LIM", "min": 95, "n": 2.4, "w45": 1.95, "w100": 1.7,
            "w300": 1.45, "w500": 1.3, "w1000": null, "fuel": 0.55,
            "fees": [{"fee_id": 20, "fee_comment": null, "cost_unit": 0.05}]}]
}

###

### Propone reglas de fees (air_fee_rules) desde los términos guardados de la aerolínea (EgyptAir 8296 + ATC 8265)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/tariffs/rules/draft
Content-Type: application/json

{"airline_id": 8296, "company_ids": [8265], "text": "Transit Shipment Fee: $.05/kg with a $25.00 min (not applicable for Final destination CAI)."}
